-- Combat presentation: projectile travel, terrain blending, appearance/removal cues and cast-level primary audio.
-- Only the named cosmetic paths change. Current balance, effect ordering and other staff edits are retained.
-- Each content row is compared with its reviewed version and effects; later edits skip that row instead of being overwritten.
-- Asset conflicts keep the existing row; content depending on a new asset also checks its published metadata.
-- Existing battles retain their initiation-time catalogue. New battles load the migrated catalogue.

